  <h2>2. Product and availability</h2>
  <p>Siesta is a one-time paid digital application for Apple Watch, with an iPhone companion. The watch app requires watchOS 11 or later, a compatible Apple Watch, and permission to read heart-rate data through HealthKit. Siesta estimates sleep onset from heart-rate trends; it does not collect movement data, identify daydreaming, or measure sleep stages. Very still wakeful rest may resemble sleep and start the countdown early. It is not a medical device and does not promise exact sleep-onset detection. A fail-safe wake is scheduled when a nap starts.</p>

  <h2>3. Price and purchase</h2>
  <p>The website does not take payment or conclude a sale. Purchases are made through the Apple App Store. The price, applicable taxes, payment method, delivery, and store transaction terms are shown by Apple for the customer’s storefront before purchase. Siesta is a one-time purchase, not a subscription. Any refund request for an App Store transaction should be made through Apple’s applicable process. Nothing in these terms limits mandatory consumer rights.</p>

