  <p>After a successful App Store purchase, the app is made available for download through the store. A compatible iPhone, Apple Watch, operating-system version, and required device permissions are needed. The publisher will provide updates required by applicable law and may issue other maintenance or compatibility updates. Keep the operating systems supported by the current store listing up to date.</p>

